# env.required — vars without which the skill's scripts cannot run.
# NONE. Every script runs key-free:
#   - graphics.py / extract_style.py / source_images.py are stdlib-only (Pillow optional).
#   - render.mjs needs only the bundled Playwright chromium (no external key).
#   - the agent authors the HTML/copy, so no LLM key is consumed by a script.
